lear's FRAME_OWNED_BY_THREAD: a frame"] [232 2 "// blocked on another thread, as multiprocessing's _feed in its wait, reached through a traceback handed across, as"] [233 2 "// a future's exception, and cleared by traceback.clear_frames: unittest's assertRaises lost the feeder's locals)"] [253 1 "// frameClear is frame.clear() (frame_clear_impl): an executing or suspended frame refused; a generator's not started"] [254 1 "// closed; else the locals, cells, value stack, extra locals and f_trace dropped (frame_tp_clear), the code, globals,"] [255 1 "// builtins and f_back kept."] [281 1 "// FrameLocalsProxy is frame.f_locals of a function's frame (PEP 667; Objects/frameobject.c's PyFrameLocalsProxy_Type):"] [282 1 "// a mapping over the frame itself, reads and writes going to its fast locals and cells, so a write is seen by the"] [283 1 "// frame's code at its next load (the loop's and the compiled code's loads read f.Fast and f.Cells, never a copy:"] [284 1 "// survey \"Design: 219\"); a name none of the code's goes to the frame's extra locals."] [287 1 "// FrameLocalsProxyType is the proxy's type (\"FrameLocalsProxy\", registered as a Mapping by _collections_abc)."] [292 1 "// frameSlot is one of a code's names in co_localsplusnames' order: the fast locals (a parameter that is a cell read"] [293 1 "// through its cell), then the cells that are no parameter, then the free variables."] [296 18 "// the index in f.Fast or f.Cells, -1 for the other"] [297 18 "// an earlier slot has the name (each)"] [333 1 "// slotValue is s's value in f, nil when unbound."] [362 1 "// slotOf is framelocalsproxy_getkeyindex: the slot of key's name, an exact str by its text, else any key by its hash"] [363 1 "// and ==; read: only a bound one. -1 when none."] [415 1 "// set is framelocalsproxy_setitem (v nil: del): a local's slot written, never removed; else the extra locals."] [447 1 "// each calls fn on the bound names and their values in order, then the extra locals'. A name twice among the slots"] [448 1 "// (an inlined comprehension's own name in a fast slot beside the function's cell of that name, while the comprehension"] [449 1 "// runs: GH-128396's case, one slot in CPython holding the plain value) gives its first bound slot's value."] [475 1 "// dict is the proxy's items as a new dict (PyDict_Update(dict, proxy))."] [487 1 "// merge is framelocalsproxy_merge: other a dict or a proxy, each of its keys set; false for another mapping."] [587 2 "// nb_or: either operand the proxy, the result a dict of the left's items, then the right's"] [733 1 "// cIntArg is a C int argument: an int, OverflowError beyond 32 bits."]] :go/pos {:name [1 9] :package [1 1]} :go/semis [[12 23] [38 20] [66 25] [91 14] [91 24] [143 42] [158 28] [228 23] [235 19] [235 29] [242 25] [263 23] [264 25] [371 24] [381 22] [403 21] [404 26] [454 25] [456 14] [456 38] [464 19] [465 44] [490 39] [492 34] [497 26] [508 24] [521 35] [554 36] [561 31] [594 37] [601 25] [613 31] [620 41] [626 43] [634 42] [642 41] [648 49] [652 27] [652 34] [658 43] [703 40] [715 22] [716 26] [720 31]]} (go/file "tbobj.go" :imports [])

